# Code hygiene

- Every file: section comments (`IMPORTS` / `TYPES` / `COMPONENT` / `EXPORTS` as used). No fluff inline comments.
- `"use client"` first when needed → React → local near→far → third-party.
- Headless behavior libs (Floating UI, etc.): only via `package/ui/libs/`.
- CLI / docs-kit: import `cn`, `lucide-react` (and similar) **directly** — never through `libs/`.
- One export: inline `export`. Multiple: `EXPORTS` section.
- Prop order: `ref`, `render`, custom, native, `disabled`, `className`, `children`, `...props`. Same in the owned `mergeProps` bag; full bag/lock order → `component-tsx.mdc`. CLI JSX spread order → `new-cli-wrapper` skill.
